   "title": "About this workflow",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "MoodCraft · Paint to edit / inpaint (Flux Klein)\n\nLoad Image = the picture; second Load Image = the mask (white = change, black = keep; the red channel is used). Describe what goes in the white area. Outside the mask the original pixels are pasted back exactly. Uses CFG 3.5.\n\nTip: you can also right-click a Load Image > Open in MaskEditor and wire its MASK output instead.\n\nModels (Flux 3 Image Klein, int8): diffusion_models/flux3-image-klein-base-int8-convrot.safetensors, text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_int8_convrot.safetensors (type flux3), vae/flux2-vae.safetensors.\n\nSame graph MoodCraft queues; the app fills in prompt, seed, size and images itself. Core ComfyUI nodes only."
